2. Files derived from GROMACS files (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These were taken from GROMACS and then modified for MINFF. The modifications
are by Michael Holmboe; the underlying files remain under the LGPL.

  min.ff/flexwat-ferguson.itp  from GROMACS share/top
  min.ff/residuetypes.dat      from GROMACS share/top; the Mineral, Kaolinite,
                               Montmorillonite and Ion entries were added or
                               rewritten for MINFF
  min.ff/spc.itp               from GROMACS share/top/amber96.ff
  min.ff/spce.itp              from GROMACS share/top/gromos45a3.ff
  min.ff/tip3p.itp             from GROMACS share/top/gromos45a3.ff
  min.ff/tip5p.itp             from GROMACS share/top/amber96.ff
  min.ff/tips3p.itp            from GROMACS share/top/charmm27.ff
  min.ff/watermodels.dat       from GROMACS share/top/amber96.ff
  min.ff/atomtypes.atp         partly derived: 22 entries (C, CH1, CH2, CH3,
                               CL, F, FE, IW, MNH3, MW, N, NE, NL, NT, NZ, O,
                               OW, OWT3, OWT4, P, S, SI) match
                               share/top/gromos43a2.ff/atomtypes.atp. The
                               remaining MINFF atom types are original.

