-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution for scientific content
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Licensing aside, the following are taken from the published literature and
should be cited when used. Numerical parameters are facts rather than
copyrightable expression, so no licence restriction attaches to them, but the
original work deserves credit.

  - Ion parameters in min.ff/ions.itp: Joung & Cheatham (2008), Aqvist (1990),
    Babu & Lim (2006), and Li, Song, Merz and co-workers (2015-2021). Full
    references are listed in the header of ions.itp.
  - Water model parameters: the respective original publications for SPC,
    SPC/E, TIP3P, TIP4P, TIP4P-Ew, TIP4P/2005, TIP5P, OPC and OPC3.
  - M-O-H angle parameters: Pouvreau, Greathouse, Cygan and Kalinichev,
    J. Phys. Chem. C 2019, 123, 11628-11638.
  - Oxygen charge smearing: Lammers et al. (2017),
    doi:10.1016/j.jcis.2016.11.084.
  - CLAYFF comparison parameters: Cygan, Liang and Kalinichev,
    J. Phys. Chem. B 2004, 108, 1255-1266.
  - Crystal structures under Systems/: the crystallographic studies listed in
    the reference table in README.md.
